  <style>
    /* Values grid */
    .values-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0 32px;
    }
    .value-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 26px 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(232,223,208,.4);
    }
    .value-card .value-icon {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: block;
    }
    .value-card h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1A1A2E;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .value-card p {
      font-size: .88rem;
      color: #737373;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    /* Stats grid */
    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 24px 0 32px;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 24px 18px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(232,223,208,.4);
    }
    .stat-card .stat-number {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #F28C38;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .stat-card .stat-label {
      font-size: .8rem;
      color: #737373;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .stats-grid .stat-card:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    }

    /* Trust badges */
    .trust-badges {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin: 20px 0 8px;
    }
    .trust-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(232,223,208,.6);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 7px 16px;
      font-size: .8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1A1A2E;
    }
    .trust-badge .badge-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #22C55E;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Security list */
    .security-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding-left: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .security-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: .95rem;
      color: #525252;
      padding: 6px 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .security-list li::before {
      content: '✓';
      color: #22C55E;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: .95rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    /* Cities tag list */
    .city-tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin: 12px 0 0;
    }
    .city-tag {
      background: rgba(242,140,56,.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(242,140,56,.15);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 5px 14px;
      font-size: .82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #F28C38;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="blog-nav">
    <div class="blog-nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="brand"><img src="/img/logo.svg" alt="Bookwize"> Bookwize</a>
      <div class="blog-nav-links">
        <a href="/blog" data-en="Blog" data-fr="Blogue">Blog</a>
        <a href="/#pricing" data-en="Pricing" data-fr="Tarifs">Pricing</a>
        <div class="lang-toggle" onclick="toggleLang()">
          <span class="lang-label lang-en">EN</span>
          <div class="lang-switch"><div class="lang-knob"></div></div>
          <span class="lang-label lang-fr">FR</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/admin/signup" class="btn-sm" data-en="Start Free Trial" data-fr="Essai gratuit">Start Free Trial</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <article class="blog-article">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="article-header">
      <a href="/" class="back-link" data-en="&larr; Back to Home" data-fr="&larr; Retour à l'accueil">&larr; Back to Home</a>
      <h1 data-en="About Bookwize" data-fr="À propos de Bookwize">About Bookwize</h1>
      <div class="article-meta" data-en="Built in Montreal. Made for Canadian service businesses." data-fr="Construit à Montréal. Conçu pour les entreprises de services canadiennes.">Built in Montreal. Made for Canadian service businesses.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="article-body">

      <!-- Our Story -->
      <h2 data-en="Our Story" data-fr="Notre histoire">Our Story</h2>

      <p data-en="Bookwize was founded in Montreal, Quebec in 2026 — by a team that spent time watching Canadian salon and barbershop owners struggle with the same frustrating problem." data-fr="Bookwize a été fondée à Montréal, Québec en 2026 — par une équipe qui a observé les propriétaires de salons et de barbershops canadiens aux prises avec le même problème frustrant.">Bookwize was founded in Montreal, Quebec in 2026 — by a team that spent time watching Canadian salon and barbershop owners struggle with the same frustrating problem.</p>

      <p data-en="The booking platforms available were expensive, took commission on every appointment, and were built entirely for the US market. No French support. No CAD pricing. No understanding of what it means to run a small business in Canada." data-fr="Les plateformes de réservation disponibles étaient coûteuses, prélevaient une commission sur chaque rendez-vous, et étaient entièrement conçues pour le marché américain. Pas de support en français. Pas de tarification en dollars canadiens. Aucune compréhension de ce que signifie gérer une petite entreprise au Canada.">The booking platforms available were expensive, took commission on every appointment, and were built entirely for the US market. No French support. No CAD pricing. No understanding of what it means to run a small business in Canada.</p>

      <p data-en="So we built something better. Bookwize is an affordable, commission-free booking system built specifically for the Canadian market — with bilingual French-English support, CAD pricing, and white-label branding that puts your business front and centre, not ours." data-fr="Nous avons donc construit quelque chose de mieux. Bookwize est un système de réservation abordable et sans commission, conçu spécifiquement pour le marché canadien — avec le support bilingue français-anglais, les prix en dollars canadiens, et le branding en marque blanche qui place votre entreprise au premier plan, pas la nôtre.">So we built something better. Bookwize is an affordable, <strong>commission-free</strong> booking system built specifically for the Canadian market — with bilingual French-English support, CAD pricing, and white-label branding that puts your business front and centre, not ours.</p>

      <p data-en="Today, Bookwize serves businesses across Canada:" data-fr="Aujourd'hui, Bookwize sert des entreprises partout au Canada :">Today, Bookwize serves businesses across Canada:</p>

      <div class="city-tags">
        <span class="city-tag">Montréal</span>
        <span class="city-tag">Toronto</span>
        <span class="city-tag">Vancouver</span>
        <span class="city-tag">Calgary</span>
        <span class="city-tag">Ottawa</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Our Values -->
      <h2 data-en="Our Values" data-fr="Nos valeurs" style="margin-top:48px">Our Values</h2>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-card">
          <span class="value-icon">💸</span>
          <h3 data-en="Commission-free, always" data-fr="Sans commission, toujours">Commission-free, always</h3>
          <p data-en="You keep 100% of your revenue. Every booking, every client — new or returning. We charge a flat fee and nothing more." data-fr="Vous gardez 100% de vos revenus. Chaque réservation, chaque client — nouveau ou existant. Nous facturons un tarif fixe, rien de plus.">You keep 100% of your revenue. Every booking, every client — new or returning. We charge a flat fee and nothing more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <span class="value-icon">🍁</span>
          <h3 data-en="Built for Canada" data-fr="Conçu pour le Canada">Built for Canada</h3>
          <p data-en="Bilingual French-English support, CAD pricing, and a team based in Montreal. We understand the Canadian market because we're part of it." data-fr="Support bilingue français-anglais, prix en dollars canadiens, et une équipe basée à Montréal. Nous comprenons le marché canadien parce que nous en faisons partie.">Bilingual French-English support, CAD pricing, and a team based in Montreal. We understand the Canadian market because we're part of it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <span class="value-icon">⚡</span>
          <h3 data-en="Simplicity first" data-fr="La simplicité avant tout">Simplicity first</h3>
          <p data-en="Set up your entire booking system in 5 minutes. No technical knowledge required. If it's complicated, we haven't done our job." data-fr="Configurez l'intégralité de votre système de réservation en 5 minutes. Aucune connaissance technique requise. Si c'est compliqué, nous n'avons pas fait notre travail.">Set up your entire booking system in 5 minutes. No technical knowledge required. If it's complicated, we haven't done our job.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <span class="value-icon">🏷️</span>
          <h3 data-en="Your brand, not ours" data-fr="Votre marque, pas la nôtre">Your brand, not ours</h3>
          <p data-en="White-label means your clients see your business name, your colours, your logo. Not Bookwize. Your brand is what builds loyalty — we just power it." data-fr="La marque blanche signifie que vos clients voient le nom de votre entreprise, vos couleurs, votre logo. Pas Bookwize. C'est votre marque qui fidélise — nous la propulsons simplement.">White-label means your clients see your business name, your colours, your logo. Not Bookwize. Your brand is what builds loyalty — we just power it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust & Security -->
      <h2 data-en="Trust &amp; Security" data-fr="Confiance et sécurité">Trust &amp; Security</h2>

      <p data-en="We take security seriously. Here's exactly how your data — and your clients' data — is protected." data-fr="Nous prenons la sécurité au sérieux. Voici exactement comment vos données — et celles de vos clients — sont protégées.">We take security seriously. Here's exactly how your data — and your clients' data — is protected.</p>

      <ul class="security-list">
        <li data-en="All data encrypted in transit with HTTPS/TLS" data-fr="Toutes les données chiffrées en transit avec HTTPS/TLS">All data encrypted in transit with HTTPS/TLS</li>
        <li data-en="Passwords hashed with bcrypt — never stored in plain text" data-fr="Mots de passe hachés avec bcrypt — jamais stockés en clair">Passwords hashed with bcrypt — never stored in plain text</li>
        <li data-en="Payments processed securely through Stripe — we never store card details" data-fr="Paiements traités de façon sécurisée via Stripe — nous ne stockons jamais les données de carte">Payments processed securely through Stripe — we never store card details</li>
        <li data-en="No tracking cookies — session cookies only, no third-party ad trackers" data-fr="Pas de cookies de suivi — cookies de session uniquement, pas de traceurs publicitaires tiers">No tracking cookies — session cookies only, no third-party ad trackers</li>
        <li data-en="You own your data — export or delete it anytime, no questions asked" data-fr="Vous possédez vos données — exportez-les ou supprimez-les à tout moment, sans question">You own your data — export or delete it anytime, no questions asked</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="trust-badges">
        <span class="trust-badge"><span class="badge-dot"></span><span data-en="Stripe Verified Partner" data-fr="Partenaire vérifié Stripe">Stripe Verified Partner</span></span>
        <span class="trust-badge"><span class="badge-dot"></span><span data-en="SSL Secured" data-fr="Sécurisé SSL">SSL Secured</span></span>
        <span class="trust-badge"><span class="badge-dot"></span><span data-en="PIPEDA Compliant" data-fr="Conforme à la LPRPDE">PIPEDA Compliant</span></span>
      </div>

      <!-- By the Numbers -->
      <h2 data-en="By the Numbers" data-fr="En chiffres" style="margin-top:48px">By the Numbers</h2>

      <p data-en="Early numbers from businesses using Bookwize across Canada:" data-fr="Premiers résultats des entreprises utilisant Bookwize partout au Canada :">Early numbers from businesses using Bookwize across Canada:</p>

      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">1,000+</span>
          <span class="stat-label" data-en="appointments booked" data-fr="rendez-vous réservés">appointments booked</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">10+</span>
          <span class="stat-label" data-en="businesses trust Bookwize" data-fr="entreprises font confiance à Bookwize">businesses trust Bookwize</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">4.9/5</span>
          <span class="stat-label" data-en="customer rating" data-fr="satisfaction client">customer rating</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">38%</span>
          <span class="stat-label" data-en="fewer no-shows with reminders" data-fr="moins d'absences grâce aux rappels">fewer no-shows with reminders</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">0%</span>
          <span class="stat-label" data-en="commission — always" data-fr="commission — toujours">commission — always</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div><!-- /.article-body -->

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="article-cta">
      <p data-en="Ready to try Bookwize? Set up your booking page in 5 minutes — free for 14 days, no credit card required." data-fr="Prêt à essayer Bookwize? Configurez votre page de réservation en 5 minutes — gratuit pendant 14 jours, aucune carte de crédit requise.">Ready to try Bookwize? Set up your booking page in 5 minutes — free for 14 days, no credit card required.</p>
      <a href="/admin/signup" class="cta-btn" data-en="Start Free Trial" data-fr="Essai gratuit">Start Free Trial</a>
    </div>

  </article>

  <script>
    let lang = 'en';
    function toggleLang() {
      lang = lang === 'en' ? 'fr' : 'en';
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-en]').forEach(el => {
        el.innerHTML = el.getAttribute('data-' + lang);
      });
      document.querySelector('.lang-toggle').classList.toggle('fr-active', lang === 'fr');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
